Main_Char: (I've returned to the village...that deer, why did it look at me like that?)
Main_Char: Hey Robert, can I ask you about something?
Daniel (passive): Hm? Yeah what can I help you with, kid?
Main_Char: I was out in the forest and...this deer felt out of place?
Main_Char: You seem like you know things, so I figured you might know something about it?
Daniel (shock): ...Deer...?
(Robert looked on guard before he resumed speaking)
Daniel (thinking): Are you positive you saw a deer?  You aren't imagining things, correct?
Main_Char: Uhh..Yeah? It was a regular looking deer but it just felt weird.
Daniel (thinking): ...
Daniel (thinking): we...don't have deer on this island.
Daniel (thinking): whatever you saw must have been something else.
Main_Char: No but I'm positive I saw a de-
Daniel (thinking): Thats enough of that, don't talk about this again, not to anyone.
Main_Char: But I-
Daniel (thinking): Drop the subject... you didn't see anything, leave it at that.
Main_Char: (he didn't let me respond, he just promptly walked away)